
 In v2:

   - GPUBusy : accumulated time in all GPU packets
   - GPUWait : Delta between last and first command packet finish/start on GPU

   - DisplayedTime : Flip to flip (frame time)
   - GPU Latency : Time from frame start on CPU to 1st packet on GPU


 Compare DisplayTime with GPUWait. That is your CPU frame time.
  If GPUWait is high it means GPU is not being fed at line rate or that GPU latency is high


 